    "g.md": "```jbogenbau\n%ambiguity-resolution greedy\n%rule text [c] ...\n%rule c \"a\" </a/> | \"space\" </./> %emits $\n```\n",
    "h.md": "```jbogenbau\n%ambiguity-resolution greedy\n%rule text $w(run) %conditions phonemes($w) = \"a a\", \"a\" ∈ words($w)\n%rule run /a/ /./ /a/\n```\n"
